  "source_first_prose_candidates": [
    {
      "kind": "SEC_HTML_PROSE",
      "node_index_zero_based": 228,
      "score": 10,
      "matched_terms": [
        "revenue"
      ],
      "text": "Our computing platforms serve a diverse set of markets such as data centers, gaming, professional visualization, and automotive. Our desktop gaming products typically see stronger revenue in the second half of our fiscal year. Historical seasonality trends may not repeat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "SEC_HTML_PROSE",
      "node_index_zero_based": 353,
      "score": 10,
      "matched_terms": [
        "revenue"
      ],
      "text": "• A significant amount of our revenue stems from a limited number of partners and distributors and we have a concentration of sales to end customers, and our revenue could be adversely affected if we lose or are prevented from selling to any of these end customers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "SEC_HTML_PROSE",
      "node_index_zero_based": 385,
      "score": 10,
      "matched_terms": [
        "revenue"
      ],
      "text": "We have invested in research and development in markets where we have a limited operating history, which may not produce meaningful revenue for several years, if at all. If we fail to develop or monetize new products and technologies, or if they do not become widely adopted, our financial results could be adversely affected. Obtaining design wins may involve a lengthy process and depends on our ability to anticipate and provide features and functionality that customers will demand. They also do not guarantee revenue. Failure to obtain a design win may prevent us from obtaining future design wins in subsequent generations. We cannot ensure that the products and technologies we bring to market will provide value to our customers and partners. If we fail any of these key success criteria, our financial results may be harmed."
    }
  ],
